#[navbar]

#[section, $md:
    @../ (Documentation) / moth-template-files

    # moth-template-files

    moth-template-files is Markdown that already lives inside Moth's template world.

    Write the content directly. Import the folded result as `content`. Reach for a
    normal `.moth` file when the job stops being content-shaped.
]

